    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋuɔ̱t ca̱ŋ lɔ̱ŋä",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ cu Muthɛ ji̱ dolä I-thɛ-rɛl diaal cɔal guäth kɛl, cuɛ kɛ jiök i̱, “Tin ci Kuoth Nhial kɛ lar i̱ bia la̱t ti̱n, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bia lät la̱t kɛ ni̱n bäkɛl, kä kɛ bärɔw ni̱ni bia tekɛ cäŋ lɔ̱ŋä, ala cäŋ mi rɛl rɔ kä Kuoth Nhial. Ram ɔ wä la̱t wä la̱t ɔ ɛn cäŋ ɛmɔ ɔ duundɛ ni ɣöö ba näk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yɛn /cia mac bi dɔp gua̱thni ciɛŋädun diaal kɛ cäŋ lɔ̱ŋä.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Luuri kɛmɛkä ro̱mä mi rɛl rɔ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Muthɛ ji̱ dolä I-thɛ-rɛl diaal jiök i̱, “Nɛmɛ ɛ min lar Kuoth Nhial jɛ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "muɔcɛ rɔ̱ muc ti bia ka̱m Kuoth Nhial nyinäkun. Ram ɔ gɔaa lɔcdɛ mɔ, a jɛ no̱o̱ŋ muc Kuoth Nhial, ala da̱a̱p, kɛ ciek in bo̱r, kɛ ciɛk in yian, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kɛ bi̱i̱ mi tekɛ biɛl mi yie̱l, kɛ mi mɛr, kɛnɛ mi do̱l kɛ bi̱i̱ mi ca mɛn agɔaa, kɛ bi̱i̱ mi̱em böwni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kɛ tuacni rue̱e̱thni de̱e̱t rɔɔmni ti thiääŋ, kɛ tuacni böwni, kɛ jiath thëëp. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ liɛɛth lɛmbärä, kɛ wal ti kuɔ̱r kuɔ̱ɔ̱r kɛ kui̱ liɛth yi̱rä kɛnɛ kui̱ wal tin la waŋkɛ wi̱i̱ yi̱kä, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kɛ guiy ti ca̱a̱r, kɛ guiy kɔ̱kiɛn kɛ kui̱ biey gɔ̱rä ran, kɛnɛ kui̱ biey kath.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋuɔ̱t luaak ro̱mä",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä a wutni diaal tin lua̱ŋkɛ la̱t rɛydun bëë, bikɛ tin diaal tin ci Kuoth Nhial kɛ lar ben la̱t, due̱l ro̱mä, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kɛmɛ ro̱mä kɛnɛ kuum wecdɛ, kɛ go̱o̱nikɛ, kɛnɛ cuɔ̱ɔ̱ŋkɛ, kɛ bëërkɛ, kɛ thieerkɛ, kɛnɛ thärkɛ tin löckɛ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kɛ thanduk kɛnɛ jiɛnkɛ tin kapkɛ ni jɛ, kɛ kuum wecdɛ, kɛ ge̱e̱lɛ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kɛ tharbët kɛnɛ jiɛnkɛ tin la kapkɛ jɛ, amäni kuakɛ diaal, kɛ mi̱eth in rɛl rɔ in ka̱mkɛ Kuoth Nhial, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŋääp lɛmbärä kɛ kui̱ maac kɛ kuak kɛ diaal, kɛ lɛmbärädɛ kɛɛl kɛnɛ liɛɛthdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ yi̱k wal tin la waŋkɛ, kɛ thieerkɛ, kɛ liɛɛth yi̱rä, kɛnɛ wäl in kur kur min la waŋkɛ, kɛnɛ bi̱i̱ thi̱ek duëël ro̱mä, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kɛ yi̱k wäŋä luuri, kɛɛl kɛ yieethdɛ min ca tak ce̱tkɛ cambak, kɛ ciɛk in yian, kɛ jiɛnkɛ tin la kapkɛ jɛ, kɛ kuakɛ diaal, kɛ thak la̱k, kɛnɛ tharɛ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kɛ bieyni kal, kɛ thieerkɛ, kɛnɛ thärkɛ, kɛ bi̱i̱ thuɔk kal, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kɛ löc duëël kɛ löc kal kɛnɛ de̱pkɛ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kɛ bieyni tin ca tak agɔaa kɛ kui̱ la̱t guäth in rɛl rɔ, bieyni kuoothä ti ɣɛ̈lkɛ rɔ̱ kɛ kui̱ bööth palä ni Ä-ron, kɛnɛ bieyni kuoothä ti gɔw ti ɣɛ̈lkɛ rɔ̱ kɛ kui̱ gankɛ, kɛ kui̱ la̱tdiɛn ala bööth palä.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "No̱o̱ŋ luuri nath",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu ji̱ dolä I-thɛ-rɛl diaal ku jiɛn nhiam Muthɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cukɛ ben kɛn nɛy diaal tëë ci lo̱ckiɛn tɔ̱tɔ̱ nhɔk kɛnɛ nɛy diaal tëë ci lo̱ckiɛn rɔ̱ jiɛ̈c cuɔ̱ŋ, kä cukɛ muc Kuɔth Nhial no̱o̱ŋ, ba kɛ ben lät ni lät duëël ro̱mä kɛnɛ lät palikɛ diaal, amäni bieyni kuoothä tin ɣɛ̈lkɛ rɔ̱. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu nɛy diaal ku ben, wutni kɛnɛ män, kɛn diaal tëë ci lɔcdiɛn ɛ nhɔk i̱ bikɛ muɔ̱c. Cukɛ ti diaal no̱o̱ŋ tiil ji̱thni, kɛ tiil yiɛtni, kɛ ciik te̱tni, kɛ ti diaal tin ca täth kɛ da̱a̱p, cuɛ kɛ no̱o̱ŋ, cu nɛy diaal muc dääpä ka̱m Kuoth Nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä nɛy diaal tëë ca rɔ̱ je̱k, cukɛ biɛl biey mi yie̱l no̱o̱ŋ kɛnɛ mi mɛr kɛ mi do̱l, kɛ bieyni ti ca mɛn, kɛ mi̱em böwni, kɛnɛ tuacni rɔɔmni ti thiääŋ, kiɛ tuacni böwni kiɛ duäl, cukɛ kɛ no̱o̱ŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nɛy diaal tëë thöpkɛ muc cikä in bo̱r kiɛ ciɛk in yian, cukɛ kɛ no̱o̱ŋ ala muc Kuoth Nhial, kä nɛy diaal tëë ca rɔ̱ je̱k cukɛ jiath thëëp mi lot rɔ rɛy la̱t no̱o̱ŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä män diaal tëë ta̱a̱k ŋɔaani, cukɛ tëë cikɛn kɛ tak biɛl, mi yie̱l kɛnɛ mi mɛr, kɛ mi do̱l no̱o̱ŋ, amäni bieyni ti ca lathdiɛn mɛn agɔaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Män diaal tëë ci la̱t ɛmɔ wä lɔɔcdiɛn cukɛ mi̱em böwni tak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
